+-\x1b[1m DeviceChain - dcctl install - kind devicechain \x1b[m------------- dcctl v1.12.0 -+
| \x1b[1mHelp\x1b[m - Cluster choices                                                       |
|                                                                              |
| up/down/Space  choose                                                        |
| Tab            next                                                          |
| Esc            back                                                          |
| q              exit                                                          |
| ?/F1           help                                                          |
| Ctrl+C         exit                                                          |
|                                                                              |
| Each change re-resolves the plan as the command line would, and runs the     |
| read-only checks again for it. Continue shows the review; Back returns to    |
| the checks. Nothing has been changed yet: nothing on these screens changes   |
| anything until you approve the plan on the review. Ctrl+C exits.             |
|                                                                              |
